opencv-python
psutil
nvidia-ml-py
loguru
scipy
lap
cython-bbox
cython
filterpy
# The system-tray icon the volunteer controls the worker from (#57), and the
# library that draws its bitmap. Pillow already arrives through ultralytics;
# it is named here because tray.py imports it directly, and a dependency you
# import is one you declare rather than one you inherit.
pystray
pillow
pyinstaller==6.22.2
#
# torch 2.11.0 across EVERY variant, deliberately. It is the newest version
# present on the cu126, cu128 and cpu indexes alike, and one version across the
# whole pool is worth more than a newer one on part of it: cu126 pinned 2.14.0
# and cu128 pinned 2.10.0, and the pool has been running three different torch
# versions against the same job specs. This is a downgrade for cu126 machines
# from 2.14.0, taken on purpose.
#
# CUDA 12.6: sm_50-sm_90, Maxwell through Hopper. The only variant that serves
# a GTX 900 or GTX 10-series card, which is the spare GPU a volunteer is most
# likely to donate.
torch==2.11.0+cu126
torchvision==0.26.0+cu126
